      en: ["Sha Tau Kok was a closed border town from 1951 to 2012.", "The population is about 7,000.", "It is located directly on the border with Guangdong, China.", "Sha Tau Kok Wetland Park hosts rare bird species.", "The ferry connects Sha Tau Kok to Lai Chi Wo.", "Since 2012, visits are possible with a special permit."],
      es: ["Sha Tau Kok fue una ciudad fronteriza cerrada de 1951 a 2012.", "La población es de unos 7.000 habitantes.", "El lugar está justo en la frontera con Guangdong, China.", "El Sha Tau Kok Wetland Park alberga especies de aves raras.", "El ferry conecta Sha Tau Kok con Lai Chi Wo.", "Desde 2012 es posible visitarlo con permiso especial."],
